RR_kwDOAO6SJc6ndueD","user":{"login":"MJacred","id":6639237,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjY2MzkyMzc=","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/6639237?u=89d4350f70d480d0457417ef122a7aaa1bb633f7&v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/MJacred","html_url":"https://github.com/MJacred","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/MJacred/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/MJacred/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/MJacred/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/MJacred/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/MJacred/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/MJacred/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/MJacred/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/MJacred/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/MJacred/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"body":"> Should I also rename the project settings category from `Controller` to `Joypad` ?\r\n\r\nThat's a really good question… While the [tutorial](https://docs.godotengine.org/en/stable/tutorials/inputs/controllers_gamepads_joysticks.html) mostly uses the term `Controller`, the API uses `Joypad`. I'd say conforming to the API is more important, so changing it to `Joypad` is the way to go\r\n\r\n_EDIT_: in the xml files, it should be `does not` instead of `do not`","state":"CHANGES_REQUESTED","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/105513#pullrequestreview-2809587587","pull_request_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/105513","author_association":"CONTRIBUTOR","_links":{"html":{"href":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/105513#pullrequestreview-2809587587"},"pull_request":{"href":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/105513"}},"submitted_at":"2025-05-01T10:48:27Z","commit_id":null},{"id":2853736658,"node_id":"PRR_kwDOAO6SJc6qGJDS","